$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2hwrd2  LOC_AFTER=?

* The accumulating word-recursion rule of the fragment calculus of the machine layer: a family of classes of configurations indexed by the word still to scan and by the accumulated output, each reaching the family member of the tail with the letter prepended to the accumulator within ` P ` steps, reaches the empty-word member with the reversed word prepended to the accumulator within ` ( # ` X ) x. P ` steps.  This is the induction every mover fragment of Lean's Arith.lean and Prims.lean runs by hand (` moveNum_loop ` , ` move2Num_loop ` , ` incLoop_loop ` , ` predLoop_loop ` ) and the one the machine model spends ~ revrun on.

